### Configuración de Variables Globales
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}

### ==========================================
### 1. MÓDULO DE AUTENTICACIÓN (AUTH)
### ==========================================

### Generar JWT con las credenciales del .env
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### ==========================================
### 2. MÓDULO DE ESTANTERÍAS (SHELVES)
### ==========================================

### Listar todas las estanterías (GET /)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Obtener una estantería por ID (GET /:id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/shelves/3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Crear una nueva estantería (POST /)
POST {{baseUrl}}/shelves/
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "0001",
  "location": "baja",
  "description": "Estantería de Terror"
}

###

### Actualizar una estantería (PUT /:id)
# 💡 Corregido: Usamos los campos reales de tu estantería en lugar de "name"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/shelves/0001
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Estantería de Terror Modificada"
}

###

### Eliminar una estantería (DELETE /:id)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/shelves/3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}